ncomplete.\",\"recommendation\":\"Reconcile objected items against current billing. Verify if conciliated amount ($4,260.42 or $4,476.60) has been properly deducted. Ensure objected medications not in the billing table were already removed.\"},{\"findingId\":\"F-011\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"riskLevel\":\"LOW\",\"diagnosisCode\":null,\"procedureCode\":null,\"serviceCode\":\"8470009722678\",\"description\":\"Room charge 'PRIVADO PEQUEÑO CUARTA PLANTA' ($3,500.00) billed on 15/06/2024 but patient was in ICU (HABC CUIDADO INT. POLIVALENTE) on 13/06 and 14/06. Transition from ICU to private room appears consistent with discharge preparation.\",\"serviceDate\":\"15/06/2024\",\"quantity\":1,\"sourceDocument\":\"Factura y Desglose\",\"sourceField\":\"Tabla de Servicios facturados\",\"matchedRuleId\":null,\"payerPolicyId\":null,\"reason\":\"Room type transition from ICU to private room is clinically consistent with post-surgical recovery progression. No coding conflict detected, but general coding validation is limited for room charges as no specific rule applies.\",\"recommendation\":\"No action required. Room transition is clinically appropriate given ICU stay on days 1-2 and step-down to private room on day 3.\"},{\"findingId\":\"F-012\",\"type\":\"LOW_CONFIDENCE_EXTRACTION\",\"riskLevel\":\"MEDIUM\",\"diagnosisCode\":null,\"procedureCode\":null,\"serviceCode\":null,\"description\":\"Objection form authorization number '9089941/4677889' extracted with 0.50 OCR confidence and 0.46 extraction confidence.\",\"serviceDate\":null,\"quantity\":null,\"sourceDocument\":\"Formulario de Objeciones Auditoría Médica\",\"sourceField\":\"No. Autorización\",\"matchedRuleId\":null,\"payerPolicyId\":null,\"reason\":\"Authorization number is critical for claim processing and has very low extraction confidence. Incorrect authorization number could cause claim rejection.\",\"recommendation\":\"Manually verify authorization number(s) against ARS Primera records before resubmission.\"}],\"missin